# ============================================================ 0. IMPORTANT — USE THE APPROVED VISUAL DIRECTION

A visual exploration has already been generated separately.

Use the SINGLE visual direction selected by the project owner as the canonical design reference.

Do NOT mix multiple rejected concepts.

Do NOT redesign the identity.

Do NOT introduce a new visual direction.

Everything created in this task must belong to ONE coherent OX-DX visual system.

The approved visual identity combines:

QURANIC
×
GEN-Z
×
GRUNGE
×
INTELLIGENT

The result must feel:

ancient mathematical order
\+
modern computation
\+
raw underground energy
\+
serious systems intelligence

\============================================================

1. GIT WORKFLOW
   \============================================================

Create a dedicated branch from the current default branch.

Branch name:

`feature/ox-dx-brand-assets`

Before making changes:

1. inspect current branch
2. pull/fetch latest repository state
3. create the branch
4. verify working tree
5. inspect existing folders and documentation
6. check whether an `assets/` directory already exists
7. do not destroy unrelated assets

Do NOT commit directly to `main`.

Do NOT commit directly to `dev` unless repository workflow explicitly requires it.

Keep this task isolated to branding/assets/documentation.

