Create the primary OX-DX website hero visual.

Concept:

**FROM STRUCTURE TO EXPERIENCE.**

Visual journey:

large structured geometry
→ layers
→ graph
→ observation
→ representation
→ increasingly fine resolution

The visual may subtly imply:

UNIVERSE
↓
STRUCTURE
↓
GRAPH
↓
